+# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
+# EMAC (enhanced multiply-accumulate unit)
+#
+# Representation used here:
+#  * ACC0-ACC3 are 64-bit registers holding the full-precision signed sum of the
+#    products (the hardware keeps 48 bits: ACCn plus 8+8 extension bits held in
+#    ACCext01/ACCext23, which are modeled as separate opaque registers).
+#  * The operating mode (MACSR[F/I]) is a run-time setting, so it is taken from the
+#    emacFrac context bit:
+#      emacFrac=0, integer (signed) mode: 16-bit operand halves are sign-extended,
+#        products are exact, "move.l ACCn,Rx" returns the low 32 bits of ACCn and
